  "id": "causal-nexus",
  "term": "causal nexus",
  "definition": "Causal nexus is the bond or connection that links causes and effects in an ordered whole. More broadly, a nexus means the mutual dependence of parts in a series, with an added sense that they are united rather than merely related.",
